這支 SP 完全抓到關鍵了。
從程式碼第 23~29 行可以看到，使用者與角色的對應資料表是 WORKFLOW_MGMT_USERS（來源則是跨庫的 GCMAINDB.dbo.AutomatedEmployees）：
INSERT INTO dbo.WORKFLOW_MGMT_USERS_temp
    (QUEUEID, USERID, ROLE, ALERTMAIN, ALERTPERSONAL)
SELECT DISTINCT B.QUEUEID, A.CN, A.ROLE, 'Y', 'Y'
FROM GCMAINDB.dbo.AutomatedEmployees A
JOIN dbo.WORKFLOW_MGMT_QUEUE B ON B.QUEUENAME = A.WORKGROUP AND ...
WHERE ...
  EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM dbo.WORKFLOW_MGMT_ROLE D WHERE A.ROLE = D.ID AND D.FLAG = 'N')

欄位對應關係為：
 * A.CN ＝ USERID
 * A.ROLE ＝ WORKFLOW_MGMT_ROLE.ID
如何找出對應到 Checker 的 UserID
執行以下查詢，直接查當前資料庫的 WORKFLOW_MGMT_USERS：
SELECT DISTINCT 
    u.USERID,
    u.ROLE AS ROLE_ID,
    r.ROLE_DESC,
    r.ROLE_DESC_zh_TW
FROM dbo.WORKFLOW_MGMT_USERS u
JOIN dbo.WORKFLOW_MGMT_ROLE r ON u.ROLE = r.ID
WHERE u.ROLE = 2  -- 2 為 Operator - Checker (主管)
ORDER BY u.USERID;

如果想查所有主管（包含 Checker 1、Checker 2）：
SELECT DISTINCT 
    u.USERID,
    u.ROLE AS ROLE_ID,
    r.ROLE_DESC,
    r.ROLE_DESC_zh_TW
FROM dbo.WORKFLOW_MGMT_USERS u
JOIN dbo.WORKFLOW_MGMT_ROLE r ON u.ROLE = r.ID
WHERE u.ROLE IN (2, 3, 4)
ORDER BY u.ROLE, u.USERID;

備用：直接從來源人事/員工表查詢
如果 WORKFLOW_MGMT_USERS 裡面是空的（或只放目前被指派的案件暫存），直接查同步來源表：
SELECT DISTINCT 
    A.CN AS USERID,
    A.WORKGROUP,
    A.ROLE AS ROLE_ID,
    r.ROLE_DESC,
    r.ROLE_DESC_zh_TW
FROM GCMAINDB.dbo.AutomatedEmployees A
JOIN dbo.WORKFLOW_MGMT_ROLE r ON A.ROLE = r.ID
WHERE A.ROLE = 2;

